M3TiS is an independent clean-room implementation in Rust, C, C++, and CUDA.
It interoperates with open model formats and published algorithms:
- EXL3 (QTIP / MCG trellis) quantization format.
- DFlash2 block-diffusion speculative decoding algorithm (z-lab/dflash, MIT;
  GLM-5.3-Flash-DFlash2 weights, Apache-2.0).
- GLM-5.3-Flash model architecture (Z.AI Co., Ltd., MIT).
